      "node_id": "kg_doc_13",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "TDRS-6, known before launch as TDRS-F, is an American communications satellite which is operated by NASA as part of the Tracking and Data Relay Satellite System. It was constructed by TRW, and is based on a custom satellite bus which was used for all seven first generation TDRS satellites.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
